Subject: [M156] [skif] Update SkImageFilter_Base uniqueID to 64-bit

Original change's description:
> [skif] Update SkImageFilter_Base uniqueID to 64-bit
>
> SkImageFilter_Base previously assigned each filter a 32-bit uniqueID
> from an atomic counter that could wrap after 2^32 constructions and
> cause cache collisions in SkImageFilterCache.
>
> Update SkImageFilter_Base::fUniqueID and SkImageFilterCacheKey::fUniqueID to uint64_t, with an explicit zero-initialized padding field in SkImageFilterCacheKey to maintain tight packing for hashing.
>
> Bug: b/568936530
